    <comment>New package python-comfy-aimdo for openSUSE:Factory from science:machinelearning (ComfyUI cone). pluskalm is the science:machinelearning package maintainer.

INTERDEPENDENT REQUESTS - please stage together (ComfyUI cone):
  * sr#1372780 python-trampoline
  * sr#1372737 python-av (devel:languages:python; Factory 14.2.0, need &gt;= 16 for comfyui)
  * remaining cone packages from science:machinelearning being submitted in this batch

Fri Aug 21 08:59:41 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal &lt;mpluskal@suse.com&gt;

- Initial package of python-comfy-aimdo 0.4.13:
  * Pure-Python fallback; native CUDA/HIP allocator is not built
    (needs CUDA 12.8+ and a CUDA-enabled PyTorch)
  * Require python-torch &gt;= 2.8.0
</comment>
